WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
[alarm blaring]

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:04.403
- HERE!

00:00:04.403 --> 00:00:05.438
- [bleep].

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.040
- WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
COME ON.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.108
- I'M COMING.

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:10.976
- AGAIN?

00:00:10.976 --> 00:00:11.977
- STAY WHERE YOU ARE.

00:00:11.977 --> 00:00:13.780
- WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:17.750
STOP!
THANK YOU.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.118
YOU'RE NOT UNLOCKING IT!

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:20.753
- WE'RE DOING IT
AT THE SAME TIME IS THE PROBLEM.

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:21.888
- UNLOCK THE DOOR!

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:22.955
- NO.

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:24.757
NOW.

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:26.125
STOP TOUCHING IT
WHILE I DO THE LOCK!

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:28.527
- WHAT DO YOU WANT ME TO DO?
- JUST DO IT NOW.

00:00:28.527 --> 00:00:29.729
- ARE YOU...
- UNBELIEVABLE!

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:31.531
- KIDDING ME?
- STOP IT AND RESET.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.232
PUT IT DOWN.
- I'M JUST HOLDING IT.

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:34.968
- TAKE YOUR HAND OFF THE THING!
- IT IS ON THE THING.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.935
- I GOT TO RESET THE THING.
LOOK--LOOK AT THIS.

00:00:36.935 --> 00:00:39.505
HUH? HUH? NOTHING HAPPENS
IF YOU'RE HOLDING IT UP.

00:00:39.505 --> 00:00:41.674
EVERYBODY KNOWS
NOT TO DO THAT

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.142
'CAUSE NOW IT'S ALL JIGGERED
IN THE MIDDLE.

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:44.811
IT GOT ALL JIGGERED
IN THE MIDDLE NOW!

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:46.412
- [grunts]
AAH! WHAT?

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:49.482
- TAKE YOUR HAND AWAY
FROM THE DOOR COMPLETELY.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.350
THANK YOU.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:53.219
- OH, THAT'S RICH!

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.687
YOU ARE GONNA GET--

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:55.721
- DROP YOUR WEAPON.
- WHAT HAPPENED?

00:00:55.721 --> 00:00:57.089
WHAT HAPPENED, THOUGH?

00:00:57.089 --> 00:00:59.822
WHAT HAPPENED?
I DON'T KNOW WHAT HAPPENED.

